# TypeScript & Imports

- Use strict TypeScript. Prefer explicit return types on exported APIs.
- Path alias: import app modules via `@/` mapped to `src/*` per [tsconfig.json](mdc:tsconfig.json).
  - Example: `import { X } from "@/lib/x"` not relative `../../lib/x`.
- Use ESM syntax; no CommonJS `require` in app code.
- Client vs Server:
  - Add `"use client"` only when component needs browser APIs or hooks.
  - Keep server utilities free of client-only imports.
- Avoid barrel cycles. Keep index barrels small and acyclic.
